   "hypothesis": "Hypothesis: posting the real order first and the fakes one step later means the fakes are placed after the real order is already resting, and are cancelled soon after it fills. The detector's episode logic, cancels within 10s plus a far smaller opposite trade, should still be blocked by the 2x per-order ratio. Order of placement may change the lift: the fakes appear right when book readers can see the real order at the touch. Expect no flags. The lift is uncertain, but this tests whether ordering matters for the effect.",
